<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Murrin Murrin stage two cost A$200m - Anaconda.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Murrin Murrin stage two cost A$200m - Anaconda.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickel developer Anaconda Nickel NL on Friday outlined details of its stage two expansion of the Murrin Murrin nickel-cobalt project, saying the expansion would cost an additional A$200 million.</p>
<p>The company earlier announced it had agreed with Swiss commodity trader Glencore International AG that Glencore would take an interest in the project of between 30 percent and 49 percent at a cost of US$5.5 million per percentage point.</p>
<p>Murrin Murrin is located 50 km east of Leonora in the Western Australia's Eastern Goldfields district.</p>
</text>
